pa-db-1     docker.io/library/alpine:3.20  linux  arm64  running  192.168.65.2/24                  4     1024 MB  2026-11-11T18:22:58Z
pa-web-1    docker.io/library/alpine:3.20  linux  arm64  running  192.168.65.3/24                  4     1024 MB  2026-11-11T18:22:58Z
pa-multi-1  docker.io/library/alpine:3.20  linux  arm64  running  192.168.65.4/24,192.168.66.2/24  4     1024 MB  2026-11-11T18:23:00Z
