## 4c. host side, direct query to container DNS

$ dig +short @127.0.0.1 -p 2053 db.pa.fruitlocker.internal
192.168.65.2
[exit 0]

$ dig +short @127.0.0.1 -p 2053 db.pb.fruitlocker.internal
192.168.67.2
[exit 0]

$ dig +short @127.0.0.1 -p 2053 pa-db-1
